(>> 3.1 Single-Phase Transformers: Principle and EMF Equation) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(A transformer is a static electromagnetic device that transfers electrical energy) Tj
T*
(between two or more circuits via mutual induction without changing frequency.) Tj
T*
(* Working Principle: Alternating voltage V1 applied to primary winding of N1 turns) Tj
T*
(produces an alternating magnetic flux Phi\(t\) in the laminated ferromagnetic core.) Tj
T*
(This core flux links the secondary winding of N2 turns, inducing an alternating EMF) Tj
T*
(E2 according to Faraday's Law.) Tj
T*
(* Transformer EMF Equation: Let Phi\(t\) = Phi_m * sin\(omega * t\).) Tj
T*
(e1\(t\) = - N1 * d\(Phi\)/dt = - N1 * omega * Phi_m * cos\(omega * t\) = N1 * omega * Phi_m *) Tj
T*
(sin\(omega * t - pi/2\).) Tj
T*
(Peak induced EMF: E_{m1} = N1 * omega * Phi_m = 2 * pi * f * N1 * Phi_m.) Tj
T*
(RMS Induced EMF in Primary: E1 = E_{m1} / sqrt\(2\) = \(2 * pi / sqrt\(2\)\) * f * N1 * Phi_m) Tj
T*
(= 4.44 * f * N1 * Phi_m.) Tj
T*
(RMS Induced EMF in Secondary: E2 = 4.44 * f * N2 * Phi_m.) Tj
T*
(* Transformation Ratio \(K\): K = E2 / E1 = N2 / N1 = I1 / I2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 3.2 Transformer Losses, Efficiency and Voltage Regulation) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Core \(Iron\) Losses \(P_i\): Constant losses occurring in the magnetic core,) Tj
T*
(independent of load current:) Tj
T*
(1. Hysteresis Loss \(P_h\): Energy dissipated per magnetization cycle: P_h = eta_Steinmetz) Tj
T*
(* \(B_m\)^{1.6} * f * Volume.) Tj
T*
(2. Eddy Current Loss \(P_e\): Circulating currents induced in core iron: P_e = K_e *) Tj
T*
(\(B_m\)^2 * f^2 * t^2 * Volume \(minimized by thin, varnished silicon-steel laminations of) Tj
T*
(thickness t ~ 0.35 mm\).) Tj
T*
(* Copper \(Ohmic\) Losses \(P_cu\): Variable I^2*R losses in windings: P_cu = I1^2 * R1 +) Tj
T*
(I2^2 * R2 = I2^2 * R_{02}.) Tj
T*
(* Condition for Maximum Efficiency: Maximum efficiency occurs when variable copper) Tj
T*
(losses equal constant iron losses: P_cu = P_i. Load current at maximum efficiency:) Tj
T*
(I_{2, max} = I_{2, rated} * sqrt\( P_i / P_{cu, rated} \).) Tj
T*
(* Voltage Regulation: Percentage change in secondary terminal voltage from no-load to) Tj
T*
(full-load: %VR = [ \(V_{2, no-load} - V_{2, full-load}\) / V_{2, rated} ] * 100 = [ \(I2) Tj
T*
(* R_{02} * cos\(phi\) +/- I2 * X_{02} * sin\(phi\)\) / V2 ] * 100 \(+ for lagging PF, - for) Tj
T*
(leading PF\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(>> 3.3 Direct Current \(DC\) Machines: Motors and Generators) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* DC Motor Principle: Operates on Lorentz force: a current-carrying conductor placed) Tj
T*
(in a magnetic field experiences mechanical force F = B * I * L * sin\(theta\) directed) Tj
T*
